# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: GENZOMATE LIVE ENGLISH EXAMINATION PORTAL

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, database architect, UI/UX designer and real-time application developer.

Build a complete, functional, real-time English examination platform called **GenZomate Examination Portal**.

This is a teacher-controlled examination platform. The teacher must be able to manage the test, monitor every student live, end the examination, review results privately and reveal the leaderboard to all students whenever desired.

Do not create a static prototype. Build a genuinely working application.

---

