Use:

- Next.js with App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Supabase PostgreSQL
- Supabase Authentication
- Supabase Realtime
- Vercel deployment
- Lucide React icons

Use the latest stable compatible dependencies.

The application must be compatible with free-tier hosting.

# 2. DESIGN AND BRANDING

Create a professional, modern educational examination platform.

Design preferences:

- Clean white background.
- Jungle Green: #28AF60.
- Burning Orange: #FF6933.
- Dark green headings.
- Subtle shadows and rounded cards.
- Professional typography.
- Smooth but lightweight animations.
- Responsive desktop and mobile layouts.

