# 10. TEACHER EXAMINATION CONTROL

Create a dedicated examination control panel.

Include:

START EXAMINATION

PAUSE EXAMINATION

RESUME EXAMINATION

END EXAMINATION

VIEW RESULTS

REVEAL LEADERBOARD

When the teacher clicks START:

- Change examination status to active.
- Notify all registered students through Supabase Realtime.
- Display the examination on student screens.
- Start the server-controlled examination timer.

When PAUSE is clicked:

- Freeze the remaining examination time.
- Prevent students from changing answers.
- Show a paused message.

When RESUME is clicked:

- Continue from the saved remaining time.

When END is clicked:

- Immediately stop accepting new answers.
- Finalize all attempts.
- Automatically submit saved answers for active students.
- Calculate all results.
- Save results permanently.
- Generate the leaderboard.

All these operations must be controlled by the teacher.

